addf=step(r'Use $\sin(A\pm B)=\sin A\cos B\pm\cos A\sin B$, $\cos(A\pm B)=\cos A\cos B\mp\sin A\sin B$, $\tan(A\pm B)=\frac{\tan A\pm\tan B}{1\mp\tan A\tan B}$.',r'$\sin(A\pm B)=\sin A\cos B\pm\cos A\sin B$، $\cos(A\pm B)=\cos A\cos B\mp\sin A\sin B$، $\tan(A\pm B)=\frac{\tan A\pm\tan B}{1\mp\tan A\tan B}$ استعمال کریں۔',r'$\sin(A\pm B)=\sin A\cos B\pm\cos A\sin B$، $\cos(A\pm B)=\cos A\cos B\mp\sin A\sin B$، $\tan(A\pm B)=\frac{\tan A\pm\tan B}{1\mp\tan A\tan B}$ وکاروئ.')
