 work(r'\sin\tfrac\pi{12}=\sin(45^\circ-30^\circ)=\tfrac{\sqrt2}2\tfrac{\sqrt3}2-\tfrac{\sqrt2}2\tfrac12=\tfrac{\sqrt6-\sqrt2}4'),
